  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian and early recovery support to women, girls, and youth in Palestine.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Working with UNFPA, FCDO aims to provide dignity kits and capacity-building support for midwives to help address the urgent needs of women and girls. The project will also support critical protection interventions, including Gender-Based Violence (GBV) prevention and response, Sexual and Reproductive Health (SRH) services, and Mental Health and Psychosocial Support Services (MHPSS). In addition, it will provide support to survivors of violence through safe spaces for women and girls. The project will further strengthen support for young people through multipurpose youth hubs across the West Bank and Gaza, providing essential services and engagement opportunities for youth and adolescents.</narrative>
  </description>
